//Comment by yurkin:
//
//General Comment:
//Unfortunately, IGT has not yet been fixed.
//
//Line-by-line comments:
//
//File: /branches/rectangular_dipole/src/interaction.c (r1398)
//===============================================================================
//
//Line 964:       if (igt_lim==UNDEF || DotProd(qvec,qvec)<=rectScaleNorm2*igt_lim*igt_lim*(unitsGrid ? 1 : (gridspace*gridspace)) ) {
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//On a closer look, this is wrong (both for UnitsGrid=true and false). More careful analysis is required to understand which condition should be put here.
//File: /branches/rectangular_dipole/src/vars.c (r1398)

fixed

Ability to set equal values to rect_dip was added.

-size 8 -shape box -m 1.4 0 -grid 16 -pol igt_so -int igt 3 -ntheta 180
-size 8 -shape box -m 1.4 0 -grid 16 -pol igt_so -int igt 3 -ntheta 180 -rect_dip 0.00001 0.00001 0.00001
-size 8 -shape box -m 1.4 0 -grid 16 -pol igt_so -int igt 3 -ntheta 180 -rect_dip 9999999 9999999 9999999
should give equal results, but real results are different in 9th point (in mueller file).
Probably, it is a consequence of gridspace, because gridspace depends of rectScaleX.
In future we should remove dependency of gridspace

Rectangular dipole

Very important bug has been fixed thanks to Maxim.
